| control | original bytes | actual native key | actual output bytes | actual interior tokens | whole tokens suppressed | actual capture units |
| --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| SS token | `AASCH` | `AS` | 2 | 2 | 1 | 163 |
| AF token | `AEV` | `AAF` | 3 | 1 | 0 | 135 |
| raw W | `LEW` | `LAE` | 3 | 2 | 0 | 161 |
| punctuation | `A-A` | `A-` | 2 | 2 | 0 | 158 |
| empty | `(empty)` | `(empty)` | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
